    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Godavari is frequently asked in competitive exams as 'Dakshin Ganga' or 'Vridha Ganga'.",
        "Narmada and Tapi are key exceptions among peninsular rivers that flow westward into the Arabian Sea through rift valleys without forming deltas.",
        "Majuli Island in the Brahmaputra River is frequently tested as the world's largest riverine island.",
        "Hirakud Dam on the Mahanadi River and Tehri Dam on the Bhagirathi River are high-frequency questions regarding river projects."
      ],
